<wpt lat="44.513082" lon="-80.374854"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Official off road parking area on the north shoulder of 21st Sideroad, offered by the…. Fee unclear</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.518309" lon="-80.376391"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Len Gertler Side Trail, heading west. (the blue-blazed Len Gertler Side Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
